Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.62,0:00:06.90,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,279)}Sh-shut up!\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.62,0:00:06.90,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,313)}It was my first time fighting a monster, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.32,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,279)}You're such an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.32,0:00:11.68,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,279)}Stop calling me an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:19.55,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,279)}You came into the forest without even knowing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:19.55,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,313)}how to fight monsters, so of course you're an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:19.55,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,345)}Why did you come here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.55,0:00:21.30,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,279)}*whimpering*
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:26.90,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,279)}What, why are you crying all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:30.85,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,279)}Fool.\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.85,0:00:33.30,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,279)}What?\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:43.35,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,279)}You can't get stronger because\h
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:43.35,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,313)}you're too scared of getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:43.35,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,345)}My father said there's nothing to gain without sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.35,0:00:55.20,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,279)}So? Want me to train you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.35,0:00:55.20,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,313)}Who is it you want to knock down a peg?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.35,0:00:55.20,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,345)}I'll have you ready to crush them down in a month.\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:57.10,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,279)}I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:00:59.85,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,279)}For me...? Really?\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.85,0:01:11.25,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,279)}Yeah. That technique you taught me last time was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.85,0:01:11.25,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,313)}\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.85,0:01:11.25,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,345)}Even Hugo was blown away.\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.25,0:01:14.56,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,279)}Wow! Look at you. You're actually starting to scare me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:17.75,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\pos(61,279)}So, tell me your name now.\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
